\end_inset

0
\begin_inset Quotes erd
\end_inset

 and 
\begin_inset Quotes eld
\end_inset

1
\begin_inset Quotes erd
\end_inset

.
\begin_inset Newline newline
\end_inset

#+html:
 <details><summary>Show/hide solution...</summary>We see here that we have full probability of measuring 
\begin_inset Quotes eld
\end_inset

1
\begin_inset Quotes erd
\end_inset

 and zero probability of measuring 
\begin_inset Quotes eld
\end_inset

0
\begin_inset Quotes erd
\end_inset

:
